# Goal: [Migration name] phase parent


---

<!-- ANCHOR:directive -->
## 1. DURABLE DIRECTIVE

**Objective:** Move a Dutch sole trader's bookkeeping from Jortt to Moneybird through {{CHILD_COUNT}} ordered phases, so the administration ends correct, reviewed and archived.

### Decisions

Frozen choices. Changing one is an amendment.

| ID | Decision |
|----|----------|
| D1 | Jortt stays read-only. Phases read Jortt and write only to Moneybird |
| D2 | Every Moneybird write goes through moneybird-guard with its gate passed and Operator approval recorded before the write |
| D3 | Migration records and evidence stay in the git ignored `migration-workspace/` |
| D4 | Phases run in order, Phase 0 to Phase 22. New scope becomes a new child folder |
| D5 | A phase closes only when its exit gate passes with zero open stop conditions and the Operator approval is recorded |

**Sources:** [migration index]({{REFERENCE_LINK}}) and [shared mechanisms]({{MECHANISMS_LINK}}).

<!-- /ANCHOR:directive -->

