## 3. COMPLETION CRITERIA

- [ ] Every phase gate passed in order, Phase 0 through Phase 22, each gate recorded in the matching child `acceptance-criteria.md`
- [ ] Zero unresolved stop conditions at parent level
- [ ] Every Operator action in the phase records has a decision record entry with status, approver, date and evidence
- [ ] The Phase 22 cancel-or-keep decision for the Jortt administration recorded in `decision-record.md`
- [ ] The archive verified and sealed, with its storage location named in the Phase 22 record
- [ ] `validate.sh --recursive` clean across all {{CHILD_COUNT}} child packets
